<td><i><a href=\"#/wiki/Viking%20Helmet\">Viking Helmet</a></i></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td></td>\n<td class=\"\" data-sort-value=\"0.000000\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Creatures\">Related Creatures</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body\">\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Members_of_the_Order_of_the_Falcon\">Members of the Order of the Falcon</span></h4>\n<div class=\"navigation-list-wrapper\"><ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Falcon%20Knight\">Falcon Knight</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Falcon%20Paladin\">Falcon Paladin</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Grand%20Canon%20Dominus\">Grand Canon Dominus</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Grand%20Chaplain%20Gaunder\">Grand Chaplain Gaunder</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Grand%20Commander%20Soeren\">Grand Commander Soeren</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Preceptor%20Lazare\">Preceptor Lazare</a></li></ul></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div> </div>","quests":["the-secret-library-quest"]}